                        "language": "english",
                        "review": ". Visually and acoustically it's awesome \n. I like the narrative which is very good and some choices matter \n. The transitions from 1 character to another are very smooth\n. It has a lot of puzzles and exploring every corner both as the Demon and as a puppet is a must\n. Upgrading of character level\n. Upgrading of armor and weapons by killing enemies and looting them \n. Important to do side quests as these give a lot of exp , the further the story the higher the exp gained\n. Game is very addictive\n\n1 issue against is for the save file corrupted on the 44 th hour , I searched a bit online and it seems I am not the only one, I used to overwrite saves , I suggest not to do so.\n\nNevertheless  I thought I can t continue Chapter 5 , but I loaded a prior 2 saves file and it worked , had to repeat obviously some minor things, but I can continue.\n\n\nOtherwise I recommend it",
